# Airbender Ascension: "exile up to one target creature you control, then return it to the battlefield under its OWNER'S
# control". Bot1 gets four quest counters (three Ornithopters on turn 1; the kicked Thieving Skydiver on turn 3) and the
# Skydiver takes Bot2's Ornithopter (Bot1 controls it but does not own it; gaining control is not entering, so no counter).
# At the turn 3 end step Bot1 targets that stolen Ornithopter: it returns under Bot2's control. It is no longer a creature
# Bot1 controls, so it makes no fifth counter. Bot1 ends with the four counters and Bot2 has its Ornithopter back.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Airbender Ascension
Thieving Skydiver
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Island
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

